index 4479b53..13efa43 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -15,3 +15,22 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+
+## Section navigation
+
+Top News, World, Politics, Multimedia and Reports share `SectionViews.astro`.
+Each URL renders the same set of panels with its requested section visible, so
+refreshes and direct links work without JavaScript. The client switches panels
+with `hidden` and updates browser history, the title and the current navigation
+link. Panels and hydrated islands remain mounted, preserving local state and
+restoring each section's scroll position when revisited. Hidden panels are also
+excluded from keyboard navigation and the accessibility tree.
+
+All five panels are rendered on the initial request; switching sections needs no
+additional page fetch or DOM reconstruction. This trades a larger initial document
+for fast navigation. Leaving the section views uses normal page navigation;
+Astro's ClientRouter continues to handle the other pages.
+
+Run the navigation regression tests with `node --test tests/section-views.test.js`
+and compile the app with `pnpm run build`.
